== Documented changes ==
=== Gameplay changes ===
* {{i|C Section}} fetuses now only deal 75% damage every 10 frames (from 100% damage every 8 frames).
* {{i|Lil Dumpy}} now has a secondary, larger detection radius that can cause it to randomly trigger from nearby enemy projectiles.
* {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} no longer has a cooldown, but can only be used three times per floor, after which it functions as {{i|The Hourglass}} for the duration of the floor.
* Increased the cooldown of {{i|D10}} to 2 (from 1). It now "devolves" enemies instead of replacing them with a random enemy.
* {{i|Cain's Other Eye}} now follows Isaac and copies all tear modifiers/stats, but shoots in random cardinal directions and has -25% reduced damage
* {{i|Bum Friend}} can now give batteries and items from the [[Beggar (Item Pool)|Beggar pool]].
* {{i|The Black Bean}} now causes multiple farts in quick succession and leaves poisonous gas clouds.
* {{i|20/20}} now only decreases damage by -20% (from -25%).
* {{i|Isaac's Tears}} now has an added +5 damage bonus applied to the tears.
* {{i|Sticky Bombs}} now cause white creep to splash on the ground, slowing enemies.
* {{i|Breath of Life}} now takes less time to activate and recharge. Upon blocking damage with perfect timing, it will release holy beams in four directions (similar to {{i|Salvation}}) and grant a brief shield effect.
* {{i|Athame}} no longer creates a black ring on damage taken, instead it adds a chance for the ring to spawn around killed enemies (scales with luck).
* {{i|Betrayal}} no longer charms all enemies on damage taken, it now allows enemy projectiles to hit other enemies - when an enemy takes damage from an enemy projectile, it will attempt to target the enemy that fired it.
* {{i|My Shadow}} no longer creates dark chargers on damage taken, instead Isaac's shadow will closely follow him and create temporary dark chargers when enemies come into contact with it.
* Increased the damage of {{i|Lil Brimstone}} to 3 per tick (from 2.5).
* Increased the damage of {{i|Shade}} to 5 per tick (from 2).
* {{i|Razor Blade}} and {{i|Blood Rights}} now only cost a half heart after the first usage in a room.
* {{i|Ouija Board}} now grants a +0.4 tears up.
* {{i|My Reflection}} now grants a +1.5 damage up and a -1 luck down.
* Reduced the cooldown of {{i|Mom's Pad}} to 2 (from 3). It now also spawns 1 blue fly on use.
* Adjusted the cooldown of {{i|Blank Card}} with a few cards.
* A penny now appears in all curse rooms when in possession of {{i|Voodoo Head}}.
* {{i|Cube Baby}} can now be launched by melee attacks.
* The {{i|Bag of Crafting}} can no longer be crafted.
* {{i|Saturnus}} tears no longer damage grid entities (such as poop and TNT barrels).
* Items spawned from chests can now be safely picked up in the {{i|Death Certificate}} area
* Removed a redundant range increase from {{i|Crown Of Light}} (it used to counteract the shot speed decrease).
* Reduced the devil price of {{i|Sacrificial Altar}} to 1 heart.
* Increased the average amount of items available for purchase in {{r|Devil Room}}s.
* Added {{i|Backstabber}} to the [[Devil Room (Item Pool)|Devil Room item pool]].
* Added {{i|Book of Revelations}}, {{i|Stigmata}}, {{i|Jesus Juice}} and {{i|Purity}} to the [[Angel Room (Item Pool)|Angel Room item pool]] (they were previously only there in [[Greed Mode]]).
* Added {{i|C Section}} to the [[Ultra Secret Room (Item Pool)|Ultra Secret Room item pool]].
* Added {{i|Mom's Ring}} to the [[Old Chest (Item Pool)|Old Chest item pool]].
* Added {{i|Epic Fetus}} to the [[Treasure Room (Item Pool)|Treasure Room item pool]] (at very low weight).
* Added {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} to the [[Treasure Room (Greed Mode Item Pool)|Greed Mode Treasure Room item pool]].
* Added {{i|Ouija Board}} to the [[Devil Room (Greed Mode Item Pool)|Greed Mode Devil Room item pool]].
* Added {{i|Breath of Life}} to the [[Angel Room (Greed Mode Item Pool)|Greed Mode Angel Room item pool]].
* Moved {{i|Mom's Key}} from the Greed Mode [[Boss (Greed Mode Item Pool)|silver Treasure Room item pool]] to the [[Shop (Greed Mode Item Pool)|Greed Mode Shop pool]].
* {{c|Tainted Bethany}} can now use her blood charges to place bombs when in possession of {{i|Blood Bombs}}.
* {{t|Mom's Toenail}} now drops a foot every 20 seconds (previously every 2 minutes), with further reduced time for the [[Golden Trinket|doubled/golden variants]].
* {{t|Duct Tape}} now affects delayed following familiars (such as {{i|Multidimensional Baby}} and {{i|Shade}}).
* {{t|Cracked Dice}} now has a chance to trigger the {{i|D10}} effect.
* Shot speed up/down is now considered a minor pill effect, meaning other stat modifying pill effects are slightly more likely to appear instead.
* The {{r|Shop}} is now offering a discount on a variety of active items.
* [[Ultra Secret Room]]s can no longer generate near curse rooms (this fixes a rare softlock caused by using {{p|XVIII - The Moon?}} in certain floor layouts).
* [[Teleporters]], {{i|Purgatory}} cracks and [[button]]s now always render above water to aid in visibility.
* Rooms containing {{e|Pitfall|text=Suction Pitfalls}} in the {{s|Scarred Womb}} can no longer be bloody.
* Reduced the damage enemy Brimstone lasers deal to other enemies to 11 per tick (from 22).
* Increased the health of {{e|Blastocyst}}'s largest form to 300 (from 190)
* Increased the health of {{e|The Hollow}}'s segments to 26 (from 22).
* {{e|Hanger}}s can now be [[champion]]s.
* {{e|Needle}}s and {{e|Pasty|text=Pasties}} can no longer be champions.
* {{p|XVII - The Stars}} and {{p|Joker}} cards can now show up in Greed mode.
* {{e|Baby Plum}}, {{e|Bumbino}}, {{e|The Pile}} and {{e|Reap Creep}} are now locked behind the "Something wicked this way comes+!" achievement.
* Added game over portraits for spiked chests, spiked rocks, {{m|Hell Game}}, {{m|Confessional}}, buckets, mushrooms, polyps and the {{s|Mausoleum}} entrance.
* Added attack sound effects for {{i|Bob's Rotten Head}}, {{i|The Candle}} and {{i|Red Candle}}.
* Added feedback for actives with a timed recharge being ready to use.
* Added more [[Golden Trinket|golden/doubled trinket]] effects. The following trinkets received golden effect:
** {{t|AAA Battery}}
** {{t|Bible Tract}}
** {{t|Black Lipstick}}
** {{t|Broken Magnet}}
** {{t|Broken Remote}}
** {{t|Cartridge}}
** {{t|Flat Worm}}
** {{t|Hook Worm}}
** {{t|Lucky Rock}}
** {{t|Mom's Toenail}}
** {{t|Mysterious Candy}}
** {{t|Pulse Worm}}
** {{t|Ring Worm}}
** {{t|Rosary Bead}}
** {{t|Store Credit}}
** {{t|Whip Worm}}
** {{t|Wiggle Worm}}
* Added a few more [[co-op]] babies.
* Added even more new room layouts and updated various existing layouts (note that resuming a saved run from before this update may result in temporarily broken maps/rooms).
* Updated a few boss champion sprites.
* Updated the sprite of {{i|Breath of Life}}.
* Updated the "giantbook" animations.
* Updated various item qualities.
* Added French language support.
* Updated localization files.

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed the button in [[Greed Mode]] dealing damage when in {{c|The Lost|text=Lost}} form (from {{p|Soul of the Lost}} or when playing as {{c|Tainted Jacob}}).
* Fixed a few useless items, trinkets and cards appearing in Greed Mode (such as {{p|XVIII - The Moon?}}).
* Fixed {{e|Ultra Greed}} getting stuck in his dash state forever when his movement is blocked by certain objects (his dash now automatically ends after 3 seconds).
* Fixed {{e|Dangle}} and {{e|Turdlings}} not being locked behind the "Something wicked this way comes!" achievement.
* Fixed {{i|Cube Baby}} sometimes flying in the wrong direction when thrown with {{i|Mom's Bracelet}}.
* Fixed an issue with {{i|Multidimensional Baby}} that could cause laser items to damage Isaac when changing rooms.
* Fixed {{c|Esau}}'s items becoming dormant when using a revival item that changes character.
* Fixed {{c|The Forgotten}}'s {{i|Brimstone}} balls not dealing increased damage against enemies affected by Brimstone curse.
* Fixed {{c|The Forgotten}} losing his deal chance when losing a bone heart to a curse room door or similar damage sources.
* Fixed {{e|Rotten Heart}}s and Broken Hearts getting removed from {{c|The Forgotten}}'s inactive form when saving and resuming a run.
* Fixed {{c|Tainted Forgotten}}'s soul and {{c|Tainted Lazarus}}' hologram being able to exceed the movement speed cap.
* Fixed {{c|Tainted Lazarus}}' hologram being vulnerable to damage from certain sources.
* Fixed a crash caused by using a pill after using {{p|0 - The Fool?}} with {{i|Echo Chamber}}.
* Fixed a crash caused by using {{i|R Key}} with {{t|Broken Remote}}.
* Fixed a crash caused by too many knives passing through {{i|Multidimensional Baby}} at once.
* Fixed rewards from the {{p|Suicide King}} card not being seeded.
* Fixed enemy kills in the current room not giving score after using the {{i|D10}}.
* Fixed being able to go beyond the intended goal of a daily challenge using the crawlspace out of bounds teleport into the {{r|I AM ERROR}} room.
* Fixed using {{i|Forget Me Now}} while picking up another active item with the {{i|Schoolbag}} causing the other active item to be consumed instead.
* Fixed items with variable charge time (such as {{i|D infinity}}) not always having the expected amount of charge when dropped and picked back up.
* Fixed {{i|120 Volt}} attacking perma-charmed enemies.
* Fixed {{i|Adrenaline}}'s damage bonus not updating when losing a {{e|Bone Heart}} from damage.
* Fixed a rare case where {{i|Vasculitis}} would spawn a hostile fire when killing a burning enemy.
* Fixed {{i|Friend Finder}} allies being duplicated when saving/resuming as {{c|Jacob and Esau}} or {{c|Tainted Forgotten}}.
* Fixed win streaks being cleared and not being able to save/resume a run after being revived by {{t|Mysterious Paper}}.
* Fixed {{e|Bumbino}} rarely getting teleported to an invalid position after being suplexed.
* Fixed {{e|The Siren}} attempting to take control of {{i|Star of Bethlehem}} and causing damage from an invisible source.
* Fixed {{e|Tuff Twins}} being able to pass through rocks when being pulled by certain item effects.
* Fixed {{e|Vis Versa}}'s brimstone beam not always using the correct color in challenge rooms.
* Fixed an issue with pink champion {{e|The Haunt}}'s death animation.
* Fixed champion {{e|Flaming Hopper}}s not using their proper champion sprites.
* Fixed certain champion enemies (such as {{e|Globin}}s) not using the correct body color.
* Fixed status effect icons not appearing on {{e|Meatball}}, {{e|Dark Ball}}, {{e|Rag Man}}'s head and {{e|Mega Satan}}'s second phase.
* Fixed some items with no passive effect being granted by {{i|Lemegeton}} and [[Cantripped!]] challenge cards.
* Fixed various items not increasing/decreasing range as much as intended.
* Fixed {{i|Shard of Glass}} appearing with {{c|The Lost}}'s {{i|Birthright}}.
* Fixed {{i|Guppy's Eye}} not being in the [[Curse Room (Item Pool)|Curse Room item pool]].
* Fixed {{i|Chaos}} not including item pools introduced in Repentance (such as the {{r|Planetarium}}).
* Fixed double pennies, nickels and dimes healing Keeper for only half of their intended amount.
* Fixed rocket bombs exploding on contact with certain types of projectiles.
* Fixed rocket bombs being slowed down when passing through regular bombs
* Fixed {{e|Bone Knight}}s receiving more knockback from tears than intended.
* Fixed minor issues with certain room layouts.
* Fixed not being able to open the Mausoleum door when playing on the ALM1 GHTY seed.
* Fixed taking damage when going to the next floor when playing on the D0NT ST0P seed.

